@CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

### 1. Search CricAPI directly for players (e.g. Kohli, Rohit, Cummins)
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players/external-search?query=Kohli
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Import player from CricAPI into your PostgreSQL database (with full stats & photo)
POST {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players/import/c61d247d-7f77-452c-b495-2813a9cd0ac4
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get all players from your database (includes statistics)
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Search local database players by name or country
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players?search=Kohli
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get local player by ID (includes career statistics)
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Create a player manually
POST {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ben Stokes",
  "country": "England",
  "role": "All-Rounder",
  "battingStyle": "Left-hand bat",
  "bowlingStyle": "Right-arm fast-medium"
}

###

### 7. AI Analysis: Generate tactical scouting report for a player (e.g. Virat Kohli ID: 7)
POST {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/analysis/player/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customFocus": "Pacing in T20 death overs and handling express left-arm pace",
  "opponentTeam": "Australia",
  "format": "T20"
}

###

### 8. AI Analysis: Get all historical scouting analyses for player 7
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/analysis/player/7
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. AI Analysis: Head-to-Head Comparison (Player 7 vs Player 4)
POST {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/analysis/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player1Id": 7,
  "player2Id": 4,
  "matchFormat": "ODI",
  "pitchCondition": "Turning track in Colombo with grip and bounce"
}

###

### 10. AI Analysis: Get specific analysis report by ID
GET {{CricketAnalyzer.API_HostAddress}}/api/analysis/1
Accept: application/json
